Improve Liveupdate error feedback when a device has no Secrets Group by raising a clear, actionable message so users can quickly resolve the missing configuration.

For GitHub Actions workflows, added the recommended environment variables at the top of the workflow so they apply to all jobs:
  - FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24=true — opt in to Node.js 24 now  
  - ACTIONS_ALLOW_USE_UNSECURE_NODE_VERSION=true — allows falling back to Node.js 20 if needed once Node.js 24 becomes the default (per GitHub’s guidance)